  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふんふ～ん♪",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030070020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、結華じゃないか。お疲れ様\r\n楽しそうだな。何してるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサー！　お疲れー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふっふーん、よくぞ聞いてくれました！\r\nこれだよこれ！　秘密兵器を作ってたのです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "この白い布をこうして……ほら！　どう？\r\n可愛いでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ、てるてる坊主か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ご名答！\r\nさぁ、ここから大事な顔作りだよー",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "どうしよっかな～\r\nいっそプロデューサーの似顔絵でも描いちゃう？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやぁ、それじゃあ残念な感じになると思うぞ\r\nせっかくなんだから、可愛く作ってやってくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あらら？　三峰の実力をご存じない？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "この画伯にかかれば、たとえ真面目なＰたんでも\r\nポップでキュートに早変わりなんだけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっ、やばっ。はみ出した",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……画伯？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なぁにその目は！\r\nこれはこれで計算だからね、うん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "よっし、顔完成ー\r\n結構キュートに描けたでしょ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサー、こっちの窓に飾っといてもいい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近雨ばっかりだったしなぁ\r\n晴れてほしいの、わかる気がするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……違う違う。そっちじゃないよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──よーし、これでおっけー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……逆さま、だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そう！　プロデューサー知ってた？\r\nてるてるちゃんを逆さまにすると雨が降るんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、聞いたことあるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうすれば、また傘が使えるわけだ\r\n三峰のお気に入りちゃんの出番は多い方がいいからね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことか\r\nずいぶんあの傘が気に入ってるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まぁね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そんなわけだからさ、Ｐたんさえよければ、\r\n雨の日にまたお出かけ付き合ったげてもいいけど",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは、そうか。ありがとうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あー！　プロデューサーったら、\r\nまーた三峰がふざけてるって思ってるんでしょー？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなこと思ってないよ\r\n結華の言うことは、ちゃんと聞いてるつもりだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ほんとー？　信用ならないなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "じゃあ質問、答えられる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰にとって雨の日は、傘のことを差し引いても特別です\r\n……それはなぜでしょーうか！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、傘以外でか。……難しいな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "…………はーい残念でした時間切れ！\r\n正解は──",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……プロデューサーと初めて会った日が、雨だったから",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "off",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今の幸運な三峰は、あの雨の日から始まったから\r\n……だから、特別なんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだったな\r\nあの日から、始まったんだよな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう考えると、なんだか感慨深いよ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でしょ？\r\n三峰にとって、すごく大事な日なんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "アイドルとしての初心を忘れないように──\r\nあの日のことは忘れない。……絶対",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、結華とはじめて会ったあの雨の日のこと、\r\n忘れないようにする",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふっ、よろしい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005110300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "約束だからね？　プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700511/2007005110300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]